      "index": 0,
      "text": "The Harbingers kept the <i>[[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreJumpShipOrionsBelt],Orion's Belt]]</i> at the zenith [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreJumpPoint],jump point]] but now it is heading towards Coromodir IV and should arrive in three days.\n\nSo far we have identified the signatures of several <i>[[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreLeopard],Leopards]]</i> and <i>[[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreUnion],Unions]]</i> and from their total estimated mass, that's at least a [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreBattleMechRegiment],regiment]] heading towards orbital insertion.",
