    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cb7c0fe2d4f092d832dec3f"
      },
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Counting the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreAranoRoyalGuard],Royal Guard]], Aurigan house troops and mercenary and... [[DM.Factions[faction_TortugaPirates],allied]] units, we have assembled a reinforced battalion to defend Coromodir IV and [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreCordiaCity],Cordia City]] of conventional and 'Mech forces.\n\nBut against at least one regiment using [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreStarLeague],Star League]] 'Mechs and technology, the odds are clearly not in our favor here, and that's not even counting the Harbinger units already on Coromodir, either infiltrated or about to land.",
