    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cd39acbf3230ff52be3b7db"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Highly questionable that your forces here can hold off the Harbingers, or that they'll keep their WarShip away,<i>da</i>?\n\nUnless you have a surprise to pull out of your cockpit... say like a big bomb that goes boom and irradiates everyone of their 'Mechs!",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "XO, how does she know...",
