      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c81c61df2d0f28c904ace3b"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Commander, we shall deal later with this breach of operational security, although the special warheads are hardly a secret among the crew of the <i>Argo</i>.\n\nCaptain Murray, please do restrain yourself... we can't have that kind of leaks to the enemy if we want to keep the surprise element...",
