      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Surprise, professor four eyes??? \n\n<i>Tvoyu mat</i>, your surprise will be the moment after you use your nuke, when the <i>[[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreJumpShipOrionsBelt],Orion's Belt]]</i> and their fleet reply by conducting an orbital bombardment that will glass the surface of this planet!",
