      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "You're all assuming the [[DM.Factions[faction_HarbingersOfDoom],Harbingers]] can be intimidated or will follow your [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreSpheroid],Spheroid]] rules of war!\n\nThey'll smash you then loot you then kill you then raze this world.",
