      "index": 8,
      "text": "Wait for their incoming main fleet to land, then deploy all your forces outside the city and issue a big loud challenge to them and their leadership.\n\nThen defeat the Harbingers in a single decisive battle and if not... we all die anyways, in atomic fire if necessary.",
