        "id": "9cce75b2b695b3d9d832cee2"
      },
      "index": 11,
      "text": "We aren't as spread out and disorganized as [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LorePaulaTrevaline],Paula Trevaline]] and her council of pirates and criminals.\n\nBy concentrating our forces around Cardia City we are limiting the damage caused by the fighting and we can better reinforce our fortified positions, even if we lose orbital control to the Harbingers' main fleet.",
