      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c242d4c2c03e9915e52dc7e"
      },
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Chief Yang, the spaceport is currently our only way of communication with the rest of the galaxy since we have also been placed into [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreComStarInterdiction],Interdiction]] by ComStar following the destruction of Coromodir's [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHPG],HPG]] transmitter shortly after [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreSantiagoEspinosa],Director Espinosa]] was overthrown.\n\nAt the time we thought it was the work of [[DM.Factions[faction_AuriganDirectorate],Directorate]] saboteurs, now it is far more likely that the Harbingers were behind it.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 17,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cb03951f0d07b5e983be89a"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b97f45623035ac140054ca",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ca15cabc636d6697123a5d8"
      },
      "index": 17,
      "text": "<i>Perkele</i>, just like [[DM.Factions[faction_ComStar],ComStar]] did recently with the [[DM.Factions[faction_Davion],Federated Suns]] after the destruction of their HPG compound at [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[Lore],Sarna]] by [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreDavionAFFS],AFFS]] troops.\n\nYeah, that justifies the spaceport being such a priority.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 18,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c25f38dd60e84ba31eb64e9"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cc4a1805aff483c47b4c764"
      },
      "index": 18,
      "text": "And after the revelation on [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreGuldra],Guldra]] that Colonel Haust was a triple agent and had reverted back to House Espinosa, we do not trust the DropShips to anyone else than the most loyal commander, {COMMANDER.FirstName}.\n\nUnless you believe we can also use your unit to counterattack their scouting parties.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "What counterattacks?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 19,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c6cc933d617f9eda9637059"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59baac916230356416000354",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c6971fbd2da90f996e9edff"
      },
      "index": 19,
      "text": "We have detected several Harbinger lances already operating on Coromodir's surface, that must have been infiltrated using drop pods from an unseen and undetected DropShip.\n\nThose advance units must be performing recon for their main landings, so taking them down is vital.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "<color=#85DBF6FF>[Story Decision: Hunt the recon party.]</color> We can take down and still defend the spaceport.",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 20,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cc64937fa8fb5aa94d58fca"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        },
        {
          "responseText": "<color=#85DBF6FF>[Story Decision: Prioritize the spaceport.]</color> No, we need to focus on the spaceport, it is too important.",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 21,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c6841ca33c8132e638f5450"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
